__You must have completed the {p:Chains of Promathia} {p:Mission} {p:Newfound Family} to begin this Mission.__
__Note that "Newfound Family" is not an actual Mission in game; it is the epilogue cutscene with {n:Jabbos} in {z:Oldton Movalpolos} after the Mission {p:Dawn}.__
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Gumbah} in {z:Bastok Mines} (HP#3) at (J-7) inside a house on the upper walkway, in the back room, for a cutscene.
* Speak to {n:Tarnotik} in {z:Oldton Movalpolos} (K-10) for a cutscene.
* To reach Tarnotik, the best options are:
** The {p:Proto-Waypoint} warp takes you to (K-10), which is closest.
** {p:Survival Guide} to Movalpolos.
* Next, travel to {z:Mine Shaft #2716|Mine Shaft} and interact with the Shaft Entrance for a cutscene.
** {n:Tarnotik} will warp you to {z:Mine Shaft #2716|Mine Shaft} if you trade a {@i:Snow Lily|1725} {i:Snow Lily|Snow Lily|1725} to him.
** The {p:Home Point} warp to {z:Newton Movalpolos} is closest.
** Otherwise, {n:Twinkbrix} in {z:Oldton Movalpolos} will warp you directly to {z:Mine Shaft #2716|Mine Shaft} if you trade 10k Gil.
*** Use the Oldton Movalpolos {p:Survival Guide}, then head to E-13 down south.
* After the cutscene, interact with the BCNM entrance again and select **To Movalpolos!** to enter the battlefield.
* The fight is against Gloom Phantom, Awoken Vampyr Jarl, Awoken Ariri Samariri (has access to {s:Death}), and Awoken Hildesvini.
** Trusts may be used in the fight.
** Jabbos will assist and can tank one mob while you work on the rest.
*** He will engage the enemy upon drawing your weapon, regardless of your distance to the enemy.
* After the fight, you will automatically enter a cutscene and receive your reward.

[Directions if you want to unlock the Proto-Waypoint
* To unlock the Proto-Waypoint, travel through {z:Newton Movalpolos}.
* While in {z:Oldton Movalpolos}, travel to (E-13), talk to {n:Twinkbrix} and trade 2,716 gil for teleportation to {z:Mine Shaft #2716|Mine Shaft}.
* Exit into {z:Newton Movalpolos}, and travel to the furnace at (K-8).
* You will be heading south from here. If the fence/gate is restricting you from going south. You will need a {i:Firesand|Firesand|947}.
** You may farm one from {m:Moblin Roadman}/Engineer/Headman.
* Trade the Firesand to the furnace to move the fence/gate.
* Drop off at (I/J-9), and continue running south.
* Head to (E-9) (4 on the Map), and exit back into {z:Oldton Movalpolos}.
* The {p:Geomagnetic Fount} is on the left near the opening of the tunnel.

----
* **Alternatively**, take the {p:Home Point} to {z:Newton Movalpolos} and walk through the revolving gate (may need a {i:Firesand|Firesand|947}).
* Go south towards exit 4 on the map by dropping down at (J-9), and zone back into {z:Oldton Movalpolos}.

